e."}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","usage":{"input_tokens":24716,"output_tokens":756,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"total_tokens":25472}}}
{"type":"user","uuid":"d668bd86-d0ec-48df-b67e-8ea1820d0691","session_id":"0bc7a0e1-d40d-44b4-8483-9aafe24c8f5b","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"toolu_018bzyeNovXi86biArexcbTt","is_error":false,"content":"**Game Design Document Generated**\n\n## 0. Technical Architecture\n\n**Archetype:** `ui_heavy`  \n**Game Title:** `Midnight Table: Seven-Player Mafia`  \n**Resolution:** `1536x1024`  \n**Tilemaps:** Not used. UI-heavy scenes are composed from backgrounds, portrait images, panels, text, and existing UI components.\n\n### Base Classes Used\n\n| Scene | Base Class | Template |\n|---|---|---|\n| Role Reveal | `BaseChapterScene` | `_TemplateChapter.ts` |\n| Main Table Mafia Loop | `BaseBattleScene` | `_TemplateBattle.ts` |\n| Endgame Reveal / Timeline | `BaseEndingScene` | `_TemplateEnding.ts` |\n\nNo `CharacterSelectScene` is used because the requested scene list is: Title, Role Reveal, Main Table, Endgame.\n\n### Scene Flow Diagram\n\n```text\nTitleScreen -> RoleRevealScene -> MainTableScene -> EndgameScene -> TitleScreen\n```\n\n`MainTableScene` internally loops through:\n\n```text\nNight -> Dawn -> Day Discussion -> Accusation / Hot Seat -> Vote -> Elimination / Reveal -> check win -> repeat\n```\n\n### `LevelManager.LEVEL_ORDER`\n\n```json\n[\"RoleRevealScene\", \"MainTableScene\", \"EndgameScene\"]\n```\n\n### Exact Scene Keys Used in `scene.start()`\n\n| Source Scene | Destination Scene Key |\n|---|---|\n| `TitleScreen` | `\"RoleRevealScene\"` |\n| `RoleRevealScene` | `\"MainTableScene\"` |\n| `MainTableScene` | `\"EndgameScene\"` |\n| `EndgameScene` | `\"TitleScreen\"` |\n\n### Persistent Game State Keys\n\nUse existing `GameDataManager` singleton. Do not create a new persistence system.\n\n| Key | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `mafia.rolesByPlayerId` | Hidden role assignment for all 7 players |\n| `mafia.aliveByPlayerId` | Alive/dead state |\n| `mafia.playerRole` | Human player’s private role |\n| `mafia.humanVisibleMafiaPartnerIds` | Only populated if human is Mafia |\n| `mafia.detectiveResults` | Private Detective investigation history |\n| `mafia.doctorProtectHistory` | Doctor protection history |\n| `mafia.claimLedger` | Public role claims by player |\n| `mafia.voteHistory` | Public vote records per day |\n| `mafia.deathHistory` | Death and elimination records |\n| `mafia.gameLog` | Public narrator log |\n| `mafia.chatLog` | Public discussion lines |\n| `mafia.timeline` | Replay timeline for Endgame scene |\n| `mafia.suspicionScores` | Deterministic AI suspicion table |\n| `mafia.phaseName` | Current phase label |\n| `mafia.dayNumber` | Current day counter |\n| `mafia.nightNumber` | Current night counter |\n| `mafia.lastWinner` | `\"town\"` or `\"mafia\"` |\n| `mafia.lastEndingType` | `\"victory\"` or `\"defeat\"` from human perspective |\n\n---\n\n## 1. Visual Style & Asset Registry\n\n**Style Anchor:** A moody 1930s detective parlor at midnight, with a circular mahogany table under warm amber lamplight, deep shadows, gold UI trim, and blood-red Mafia accents.\n\n> Total assets exceed 8. Split generation into two calls:\n> - **Asset Call 1:** backgrounds, UI, audio\n> - **Asset Call 2:** all character portrait images\n\n| type | key | description | params |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| background | role_reveal_bg | Dark detective parlor entrance, velvet curtains, rain-streaked windows, a sealed envelope on a small table, warm lamp glow, gold and red accents | resolution: `\"1536*1024\"` |\n| background | main_table_bg | Circular mahogany parlor table seen from slightly elevated front perspective, seven chairs, candlelight, noir shadows, red voting tokens, detective-board atmosphere | resolution: `\"1536*1024\"` |\n| background | endgame_bg | Aftermath parlor scene at dawn, table scattered with role cards, red strings, dossiers, cold blue window light mixing with fading candlelight | resolution: `\"1536*1024\"` |\n| image | player_neutral | Human player avatar, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, noir dinner guest, calm expression, dark formal jacket | - |\n| image | player_suspicious | Human player avatar, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, narrowed eyes, guarded expression | - |\n| image | player_confident | Human player avatar, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, steady confident expression | - |\n| image | player_shocked | Human player avatar, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, startled expression under warm table light | - |\n| image | player_dead | Human player avatar, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, desaturated ghostly defeated expression | - |\n| image | nora_neutral | Nora, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, poised archivist with silver brooch, observant calm expression | - |\n| image | nora_suspicious | Nora, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, sharp analytical stare, eyebrow raised | - |\n| image | nora_confident | Nora, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, composed knowing smile | - |\n| image | nora_shocked | Nora, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, startled but restrained | - |\n| image | nora_dead | Nora, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, faded monochrome defeated portrait | - |\n| image | kai_neutral | Kai, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, quick-witted gambler, loosened tie, charming smile | - |\n| image | kai_suspicious | Kai, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, sly sideways glare, calculating | - |\n| image | kai_confident | Kai, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, relaxed grin, hands near lapel | - |\n| image | kai_shocked | Kai, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, smile broken by panic | - |\n| image | kai_dead | Kai, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, desaturated defeated gambler portrait | - |\n| image | mira_neutral | Mira, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, soft-spoken pianist, elegant dress, gentle expression | - |\n| image | mira_suspicious | Mira, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, worried eyes, cautious distrust | - |\n| image | mira_confident | Mira, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, quiet resolve, lifted chin | - |\n| image | mira_shocked | Mira, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, frightened gasp, hand near collar | - |\n| image | mira_dead | Mira, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, pale desaturated defeated portrait | - |\n| image | jules_neutral | Jules, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, flamboyant playwright, red scarf, dramatic calm | - |\n| image | jules_suspicious | Jules, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, theatrical accusing stare | - |\n| image | jules_confident | Jules, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, bold smirk, performative confidence | - |\n| image | jules_shocked | Jules, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, dramatic alarm | - |\n| image | jules_dead | Jules, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, desaturated defeated playwright portrait | - |\n| image | lena_neutral | Lena, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, retired inspector, stern face, gray coat | - |\n| image | lena_suspicious | Lena, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, hard detective glare | - |\n| image | lena_confident | Lena, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, authoritative certainty | - |\n| image | lena_shocked | Lena, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, controlled surprise | - |\n| image | lena_dead | Lena, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, desaturated defeated inspector portrait | - |\n| image | owen_neutral | Owen, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, nervous scholar, round glasses, timid expression | - |\n| image | owen_suspicious | Owen, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, anxious suspicious glance behind glasses | - |\n| image | owen_confident | Owen, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, tentative courage, faint smile | - |\n| image | owen_shocked | Owen, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, wide-eyed fear | - |\n| image | owen_dead | Owen, FRONT VIEW, bust shot, portrait style, faded defeated scholar portrait | - |\n| image | table_panel | Dark translucent noir UI panel with gold trim and subtle red velvet texture | - |\n| image | role_card_back | Sealed midnight role card back, black paper, gold filigree, red wax seal | - |\n| image | role_card_mafia | Mafia role card, black and crimson design, dagger silhouette, gold filigree | - |\n| image | role_card_detective | Detective role card, magnifying glass emblem, navy and gold design | - |\n| image | role_card_doctor | Doctor role card, antique medical cross, ivory and green-gold design | - |\n| image | role_card_villager | Villager role card, candle emblem, warm brown and gold design | - |\n| image | vote_marker | Red wax voting token with engraved accusation mark | - |\n| image | claim_marker | Small gold claim badge with parchment texture | - |\n| image | speaker_ring | Glowing amber circular speaker highlight ring | - |\n| image | dead_overlay | Semi-transparent gray veil with cracked glass texture for dead players | - |\n| image | button_noir | Dark rounded rectangular button, gold border, red hover accent, detective parlor UI style | - |\n| audio | role_reveal_bgm | Slow suspenseful parlor music with low strings, soft piano, rain ambience | audioType: `\"bgm\"`, duration: 20 |\n| audio | main_table_bgm | Tense looping social deduction music, muted piano, ticking clock, low cello pulse | audioType: `\"bgm\"`, duration: 24 |\n| audio | endgame_bgm | Reflective dawn reveal music, soft piano and strings, bittersweet noir mood | audioType: `\"bgm\"`, duration: 20 |\n| audio | click_sfx | Soft polished wooden UI click with faint paper flick | audioType: `\"sfx\"` |\n| audio | correct_sfx | Clear positive clue chime, bright but restrained detective tone | audioType: `\"sfx\"` |\n| audio | wrong_sfx | Low ominous sting for bad choice or failed accusation | audioType: `\"sfx\"` |\n| audio | damage_sfx | Heavy gavel strike and table thump for elimination impact | audioType: `\"sfx\"` |\n| audio | vote_sfx | Wax token placed firmly onto wood | audioType: `\"sfx\"` |\n| audio | night_sfx | Distant clock bell and extinguished candle whoosh | audioType: `\"sfx\"` |\n| audio | dawn_sfx | Window rain softening with faint morning chord | audioType: `\"sfx\"` |\n| audio | victory_sfx | Noir victory flourish with brass swell and final piano chord | audioType: `\"sfx\"` |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Game Configuration\n\nMerge the following game-specific values into `src/gameConfig.json`.\n\nDo **not** include `screenSize`, `debugConfig`, or `renderConfig`.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"gameplayConfig\": {\n    \"textSpeed\": {\n      \"value\": 22,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Typewriter speed in milliseconds per character\"\n    },\n    \"autoAdvanceDelay\": {\n      \"value\": 0,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Auto-advance delay; 0 means manual click\"\n    },\n    \"defaultMusicVolume\": {\n      \"value\": 0.28,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Default music volume\"\n    },\n    \"defaultSFXVolume\": {\n      \"value\": 0.55,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Default sound effect volume\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"battleConfig\": {\n    \"playerMaxHP\": {\n      \"value\": 100,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"BaseBattleScene compatibility value; not displayed as combat HP\"\n    },\n    \"enemyMaxHP\": {\n      \"value\": 100,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"BaseBattleScene compatibility value; not displayed as combat HP\"\n    },\n    \"handSize\": {\n      \"value\": 0,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"No card hand is used in this Mafia game\"\n    },\n    \"quizTimeLimit\": {\n      \"value\": 0,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"No quiz timer is used\"\n    },\n    \"comboTiers\": {\n      \"value\": [\n        { \"min\": 0, \"max\": 1, \"multiplier\": 1.0, \"label\": \"\" },\n        { \"min\": 2, \"max\": 3, \"multiplier\": 1.2, \"label\": \"GOOD\" },\n        { \"min\": 4, \"max\": 5, \"multiplier\": 1.5, \"label\": \"GREAT\" },\n        { \"min\": 6, \"max\": 99, \"multiplier\": 2.0, \"label\": \"PERFECT\" }\n      ],\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"description\": \"BaseBattleScene compatibility combo tiers; not used by Mafia loop\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"dialogueConfig\": {\n    \"boxWidth\": {\n      \"value\": 940,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Dialogue box width\"\n    },\n    \"boxHeight\": {\n      \"value\": 160,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Dialogue box height\"\n    },\n    \"boxY\": {\n      \"value\": 820,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Dialogue box Y position\"\n    },\n    \"backgroundAlpha\": {\n      \"value\": 0.88,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Dialogue box background opacity\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"mafiaConfig\": {\n    \"playerCount\": {\n      \"value\": 7,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Total seats at the table\"\n    },\n    \"humanPlayerCount\": {\n      \"value\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Human-controlled players\"\n    },\n    \"aiPlayerCount\": {\n      \"value\": 6,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Scripted AI personalities\"\n    },\n    \"mafiaCount\": {\n      \"value\": 2,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Number of Mafia roles\"\n    },\n    \"detectiveCount\": {\n      \"value\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Number of Detective roles\"\n    },\n    \"doctorCount\": {\n      \"value\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Number of Doctor roles\"\n    },\n    \"villagerCount\": {\n      \"value\": 3,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Number of Villager roles\"\n    },\n    \"startingDayNumber\": {\n      \"value\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Initial day counter\"\n    },\n    \"startingNightNumber\": {\n      \"value\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Initial night counter\"\n    },\n    \"roleRevealPauseMs\": {\n      \"value\": 900,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Pause after role card reveal\"\n    },\n    \"phaseBannerHoldMs\": {\n      \"value\": 1200,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Duration for phase banner transition text\"\n    },\n    \"nightPhaseSeconds\": {\n      \"value\": 45,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Displayed night phase timer\"\n    },\n    \"dawnPhaseSeconds\": {\n      \"value\": 12,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Displayed dawn phase timer\"\n    },\n    \"discussionPhaseSeconds\": {\n      \"value\": 90,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Displayed day discussion timer\"\n    },\n    \"hotSeatPhaseSeconds\": {\n      \"value\": 45,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Displayed accusation and defense timer\"\n    },\n    \"votePhaseSeconds\": {\n      \"value\": 45,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Displayed voting timer\"\n    },\n    \"eliminationPhaseSeconds\": {\n      \"value\": 18,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Displayed elimination reveal timer\"\n    },\n    \"maxDiscussionLinesPerAI\": {\n      \"value\": 2,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Maximum scripted AI chat lines per day discussion\"\n    },\n    \"maxHumanChatCharacters\": {\n      \"value\": 120,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Maximum length for human typed table message\"\n    },\n    \"votesNeededPluralityTieNoElimination\": {\n      \"value\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"If enabled, tied plurality vote causes no elimination\"\n    },\n    \"doctorCannotProtectSameTargetTwice\": {\n      \"value\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Doctor cannot protect the same target on consecutive nights\"\n    },\n    \"detectiveResultDelayMs\": {\n      \"value\": 600,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Delay before private Detective result is shown\"\n    },\n    \"mafiaWinParityOffset\": {\n      \"value\": 0,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Mafia win when Mafia alive count is greater than or equal to Town alive count plus this offset\"\n    },\n    \"seatPositions\": {\n      \"value\": [\n        { \"id\": \"player\", \"x\": 768, \"y\": 800, \"scale\": 0.62 },\n        { \"id\": \"nora\", \"x\": 455, \"y\": 705, \"scale\": 0.56 },\n        { \"id\": \"kai\", \"x\": 315, \"y\": 470, \"scale\": 0.52 },\n        { \"id\": \"mira\", \"x\": 500, \"y\": 255, \"scale\": 0.52 },\n        { \"id\": \"jules\", \"x\": 768, \"y\": 190, \"scale\": 0.54 },\n        { \"id\": \"lena\", \"x\": 1036, \"y\": 255, \"scale\": 0.52 },\n        { \"id\": \"owen\", \"x\": 1221, \"y\": 470, \"scale\": 0.52 }\n      ],\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"description\": \"Circular table portrait layout\"\n    },\n    \"leftPanel\": {\n      \"value\": { \"x\": 24, \"y\": 116, \"width\": 310, \"height\": 790 },\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"description\": \"Claim ledger, vote history, death history panel\"\n    },\n    \"rightPanel\": {\n      \"value\": { \"x\": 1202, \"y\": 116, \"width\": 310, \"height\": 790 },\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"description\": \"Chat, game log, input, reaction panel\"\n    },\n    \"topBanner\": {\n      \"value\": { \"x\": 768, \"y\": 46, \"width\": 920, \"height\": 78 },\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"description\": \"Phase banner layout\"\n    },\n    \"bottomActionPanel\": {\n      \"value\": { \"x\": 768, \"y\": 954, \"width\": 1180, \"height\": 100 },\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"description\": \"Phase action button layout\"\n    },\n    \"initialSuspicion\": {\n      \"value\": 10,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Initial suspicion score between AI players\"\n    },\n    \"suspicionSilenceWeight\": {\n      \"value\": 2,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Suspicion increase when a player avoids discussion\"\n    },\n    \"suspicionAccusationWeight\": {\n      \"value\": 4,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Suspicion increase against accused target\"\n    },\n    \"suspicionCounterAccuseWeight\": {\n      \"value\": 5,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Suspicion increase when a player counter-accuses defensively\"\n    },\n    \"suspicionVoteTownWeight\": {\n      \"value\": 3,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Suspicion increase for voting out Town\"\n    },\n    \"suspicionVoteMafiaWeight\": {\n      \"value\": -4,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Suspicion decrease for voting out Mafia\"\n    },\n    \"suspicionContradictionWeight\": {\n      \"value\": 8,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Suspicion increase for contradicted role claims\"\n    },\n    \"suspicionProtectedPartnerWeight\": {\n      \"value\": -6,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Mafia internal weight to avoid targeting partner\"\n    },\n    \"suspicionDetectiveHintWeight\": {\n      \"value\": 6,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Suspicion pressure added by Detective hinting a guilty result\"\n    },\n    \"suspicionDoctorClaimRiskWeight\": {\n      \"value\": 5,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Risk added when Doctor openly claims too early\"\n    },\n    \"aiConfidenceRevealThreshold\": {\n      \"value\": 18,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Suspicion threshold for Detective AI to openly reveal\"\n    },\n    \"aiVoteThreshold\": {\n      \"value\": 14,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Suspicion threshold for AI preferred vote target\"\n    },\n    \"aiMafiaRedirectThreshold\": {\n      \"value\": 12,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Suspicion threshold where Mafia AI begins redirecting onto another target\"\n    },\n    \"timelineMaxVisibleEntries\": {\n      \"value\": 14,\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Maximum entries shown at once in Endgame timeline\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. Entity / Scene Architecture\n\n### 3.1 Scene: `RoleRevealScene`\n\n**Base class:** `BaseChapterScene`  \n**Template:** Copy `_TemplateChapter.ts` to `RoleRevealScene.ts`  \n**Scene key:** `\"RoleRevealScene\"`\n\n#### Hook Implementations\n\n| Hook | Exact Implementation |\n|---|---|\n| `createBackground` | Display `role_reveal_bg` as full-scene background. |\n| `createCharacters` | Register only the human portrait as `player` using `player_neutral`, with expressions `neutral`, `suspicious`, `confident`, `shocked`, `dead`. Default position: `center`. |\n| `createUI` | Display the sealed `role_card_back` image centered above the dialogue box. |\n| `getBackgroundMusicKey` | Return `\"role_reveal_bgm\"`. |\n| `initializeDialogues` | Return the complete Role Reveal dialogue array from Section 4.1. |\n| `onDialogueEvent` | Handle `assign_roles`, `show_role_card`, `show_mafia_partner_if_applicable`, `play_sfx`, and `record_timeline`. Store all role, visibility, suspicion, alive, log, and timeline data in `GameDataManager`. |\n| `onChoiceMade` | For choice id `\"role_reveal_acknowledgement\"`, record the selected readiness effect in `GameDataManager` under `mafia.roleRevealChoice`. |\n| `onChapterComplete` | Start `\"MainTableScene\"`. |\n\n#### Role Randomization Contract\n\nRole assignment occurs once in `onDialogueEvent` when action is `assign_roles`.\n\nRequired role bag:\n\n```json\n[\"Mafia\", \"Mafia\", \"Detective\", \"Doctor\", \"Villager\", \"Villager\", \"Villager\"]\n```\n\nRequired player id order before shuffle:\n\n```json\n[\"player\", \"nora\", \"kai\", \"mira\", \"jules\", \"lena\", \"owen\"]\n```\n\nRandomization must preserve:\n\n- Human sees only their own role.\n- If human is Mafia, human also sees the other Mafia.\n- Mafia AI knows partner internally.\n- Detective results remain private unless revealed through chat/claim behavior.\n- Doctor protection choices remain private unless claimed.\n- Villagers receive no hidden information.\n\n---\n\n### 3.2 Scene: `MainTableScene`\n\n**Base class:** `BaseBattleScene`  \n**Template:** Copy `_TemplateBattle.ts` to `MainTableScene.ts`  \n**Scene key:** `\"MainTableScene\"`\n\nThis scene uses `BaseBattleScene` as a UI-heavy state container. It does **not** use combat cards or quiz mechanics.\n\n#### Hook Implementations\n\n| Hook | Exact Implementation |\n|---|---|\n| `get useTurnCycle` | Return `false` so the standard combat phase cycle does not run. |\n| `initializeBattle` | Set compatibility `playerHP` from `battleConfig.playerMaxHP.value` and `enemyHP` from `battleConfig.enemyMaxHP.value`. Load all `mafia.*` state from `GameDataManager`. If no state exists, redirect to `\"RoleRevealScene\"`. Do not create `QuizModal`. |\n| `createBackground` | Display `main_table_bg` as full-scene background. |\n| `createCombatants` | Create seven `CharacterPortrait` components using the `seatPositions` from `mafiaConfig`. Each portrait starts hidden; call `portrait.enter()` for each alive player. Add `speaker_ring`, `vote_marker`, `claim_marker`, and `dead_overlay` visuals as seat overlays. |\n| `createHUD` | Create top phase banner, alive count, timer display, left ledger panel, right chat/log panel, bottom action area, reaction buttons, and visible role/action hints. Use existing `StatusBar` component as the phase timer bar. Use existing `FloatingText.show` for accusation, vote, reveal, and elimination feedback. |\n| `getCardDeck` | Return an empty array. No card battle is used. |\n| `getQuestionBank` | Return an empty array. No quiz questions are used. |\n| `getEnemyConfig` | Return `undefined`. No enemy combatant config is used. |\n| `getBackgroundMusicKey` | Return `\"main_table_bgm\"`. |\n| `getGameplayHints` | Return the hints listed in Section 4.6. |\n| `onBattleStart` | Begin at `Night 1`. Show phase banner `\"Night Falls\"`, play `night_sfx`, then render night action buttons based on the human role. |\n| `onPlayerTurnStart` | Refresh all table UI: portraits, alive/dead overlays, claim ledger, vote history, death history, chat log, game log, phase banner, action buttons, and timer bar. |\n| `onEnemyAction` | Resolve scripted AI decisions for the current phase using the deterministic behavior tables in Section 4.4 and numeric weights from `mafiaConfig`. Add public outputs to chat/log and private outputs to the appropriate hidden state keys. |\n| `executeEnemyTurn` | Resolve queued AI phase actions, refresh UI, then call `completeEnemyTurn()` after the visible phase feedback finishes. |\n| `onBattleEnd` | Store final `mafia.lastWinner`, `mafia.lastEndingType`, all role reveals, vote history, death history, and replay timeline in `GameDataManager`, then start `\"EndgameScene\"`. |\n\n#### Main Table UI Layout\n\n| UI Area | Content |\n|---|---|\n| Center Table | Seven seats with name, color, personality tag, alive/dead overlay, vote marker, claim marker, speaker ring |\n| Left Panel | Claim ledger, vote history, death history |\n| Right Panel | Chat log, game log, human input summary, reaction buttons |\n| Bottom Action Panel | Phase-specific actions: Ask, Accuse, Defend, Claim Role, Vote, Investigate, Protect, Kill, Pass |\n| Top Banner | Phase name, timer, alive count, narrator cue |\n\n#### Supported Phase Actions\n\n| Phase | Human Role | Buttons |\n|---|---|---|\n| Night | Mafia | `Kill`, `Pass` |\n| Night | Detective | `Investigate`, `Pass` |\n| Night | Doctor | `Protect`, `Pass` |\n| Night | Villager | `Pass` |\n| Dawn | Any alive role | `Continue` |\n| Day Discussion | Any alive role | `Ask`, `Accuse`, `Defend`, `Claim Role`, `Pass` |\n| Hot Seat | Accused human | `Defend`, `Claim Role`, `Accuse`, `Pass` |\n| Hot Seat | Non-accused human | `Ask`, `Accuse`, `Pass` |\n| Vote | Any alive role | `Vote`, `Pass` |\n| Elimination Reveal | Any role | `Continue` |\n\n#### Win Conditions\n\nChecked after every Night kill and every Vote elimination.\n\n| Winner | Condition |\n|---|---|\n| Town | Both Mafia are dead. |\n| Mafia | Alive Mafia count is greater than or equal to alive Town count. |\n\nHuman perspective ending type:\n\n| Human Role / Winner | Ending Type |\n|---|---|\n| Human Mafia and Mafia wins | `\"victory\"` |\n| Human Town role and Town wins | `\"victory\"` |\n| Human Mafia and Town wins | `\"defeat\"` |\n| Human Town role and Mafia wins | `\"defeat\"` |\n\n---\n\n### 3.3 Scene: `EndgameScene`\n\n**Base class:** `BaseEndingScene`  \n**Template:** Copy `_TemplateEnding.ts` to `EndgameScene.ts`  \n**Scene key:** `\"EndgameScene\"`\n\n#### Hook Implementations\n\n| Hook | Exact Implementation |\n|---|---|\n| `createBackground` | Display `endgame_bg` as full-scene background. |\n| `getEndingData` | Read `mafia.lastEndingType` and `mafia.lastWinner` from `GameDataManager`. Return victory/defeat title and description defined below. |\n| `createEndingContent` | Display winner banner, all seven player portraits, full role reveal, alive/dead final state, and match summary. |\n| `showResults` | Display day count, night count, Mafia eliminated count, Town eliminated count, vote history, death history, and replay timeline from `mafia.timeline`. |\n| `getEndingMusicKey` | Return `\"endgame_bgm\"`. |\n| `onContinue` | Start `\"TitleScreen\"`. |\n\n#### Ending Data\n\n| Condition | `type` | `title` | `description` | `background` |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Human wins | `\"victory\"` | `\"The Table Has Spoken\"` | `\"You survived the midnight game and uncovered the truth hidden beneath the candlelight.\"` | `\"endgame_bg\"` |\n| Human loses | `\"defeat\"` | `\"Midnight Belongs to the Guilty\"` | `\"The parlor falls silent as the wrong names are buried and the guilty inherit the table.\"` | `\"endgame_bg\"` |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Level / Content Design\n\nUI-heavy game. **No tilemap. No tileset. No `generate_tilemap` call.**\n\n---\n\n### 4.1 Complete Role Reveal Dialogue Script\n\nReturned by `RoleRevealScene.initializeDialogues()`.\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"speaker\": \"Narrator\",\n    \"text\": \"Rain claws at the windows of the midnight parlor.\",\n    \"expression\": \"neutral\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"speaker\": \"Narrator\",\n    \"text\": \"Seven guests sit around the old mahogany table. Two carry knives behind their smiles.\",\n    \"expression\": \"neutral\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"event\",\n    \"action\": \"play_sfx\",\n    \"data\": { \"key\": \"click_sfx\" }\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"event\",\n    \"action\": \"assign_roles\",\n    \"data\": {\n      \"players\": [\"player\", \"nora\", \"kai\", \"mira\", \"jules\", \"lena\", \"owen\"],\n      \"roleBag\": [\"Mafia\", \"Mafia\", \"Detective\", \"Doctor\", \"Villager\", \"Villager\", \"Villager\"]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"speaker\": \"Narrator\",\n    \"text\": \"A sealed card waits before you.\",\n    \"expression\": \"neutral\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"event\",\n    \"action\": \"show_role_card\",\n    \"data\": { \"target\": \"player\" }\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"wait\",\n    \"duration\": 900\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"branch\",\n    \"condition\": \"playerRoleIsMafia\",\n    \"trueBranch\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"text\",\n        \"speaker\": \"Narrator\",\n        \"text\": \"Your card is crimson-black. You are Mafia.\",\n        \"expression\": \"shocked\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"event\",\n        \"action\": \"show_mafia_partner_if_applicable\",\n        \"data\": { \"target\": \"player\" }\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"text\",\n        \"speaker\": \"Narrator\",\n        \"text\": \"Another guest shares your secret. Protect them, mislead the table, and survive until the guilty equal the innocent.\",\n        \"expression\": \"neutral\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"falseBranch\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"branch\",\n        \"condition\": \"playerRoleIsDetective\",\n        \"trueBranch\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"text\",\n            \"speaker\": \"Narrator\",\n            \"text\": \"Your card bears a magnifying glass. You are the Detective.\",\n            \"expression\": \"confident\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"type\": \"text\",\n            \"speaker\": \"Narrator\",\n            \"text\": \"Each night, investigate one guest. Your results are private unless you choose to risk revealing them.\",\n            \"expression\": \"neutral\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"falseBranch\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"branch\",\n            \"condition\": \"playerRoleIsDoctor\",\n            \"trueBranch\": [\n              {\n                \"type\": \"text\",\n                \"speaker\": \"Narrator\",\n                \"text\": \"Your card bears an antique medical cross. You are the Doctor.\",\n                \"expression\": \"confident\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"type\": \"text\",\n                \"speaker\": \"Narrator\",\n                \"text\": \"Each night, protect one guest from the Mafia. Your protection is private.\",\n                \"expression\": \"neutral\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"falseBranch\": [\n              {\n                \"type\": \"text\",\n                \"speaker\": \"Narrator\",\n                \"text\": \"Your card shows a candle. You are a Villager.\",\n                \"expression\": \"neutral\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"type\": \"text\",\n                \"speaker\": \"Narrator\",\n                \"text\": \"You have no night power. Your weapon is attention: claims, votes, and contradictions.\",\n                \"expression\": \"neutral\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"choice\",\n    \"id\": \"role_reveal_acknowledgement\",\n    \"prompt\": \"How do you steady yourself before the table begins?\",\n    \"options\": [\n      {\n        \"text\": \"Observe silently.\",\n        \"effects\": { \"composure\": 1, \"visibility\": -1 }\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"Prepare to lead the discussion.\",\n        \"effects\": { \"composure\": 1, \"visibility\": 1 }\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"Watch for contradictions.\",\n        \"effects\": { \"analysis\": 2 }\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"event\",\n    \"action\": \"record_timeline\",\n    \"data\": { \"text\": \"Roles were dealt at the midnight table.\" }\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"speaker\": \"Narrator\",\n    \"text\": \"The lamps dim. The first night begins.\",\n    \"expression\": \"neutral\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"event\",\n    \"action\": \"play_sfx\",\n    \"data\": { \"key\": \"night_sfx\" }\n  }\n]\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4.2 Character Profiles\n\nUse these in `MainTableScene.createCombatants()` and `RoleRevealScene.createCharacters()`.\n\n| id | displayName | Personality | Color | Default Position | Expressions |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `player` | `You` | Human-controlled guest | Deep red | `center` | `player_neutral`, `player_suspicious`, `player_confident`, `player_shocked`, `player_dead` |\n| `nora` | `Nora` | Methodical archivist; tracks claims and vote logic | Indigo | `left` | `nora_neutral`, `nora_suspicious`, `nora_confident`, `nora_shocked`, `nora_dead` |\n| `kai` | `Kai` | Charming gambler; jokes, redirects, tests reactions | Gold | `left` | `kai_neutral`, `kai_suspicious`, `kai_confident`, `kai_shocked`, `kai_dead` |\n| `mira` | `Mira` | Soft-spoken pianist; cautious, emotional reads | Violet | `left` | `mira_neutral`, `mira_suspicious`, `mira_confident`, `mira_shocked`, `mira_dead` |\n| `jules` | `Jules` | Dramatic playwright; loud claims and counterclaims | Crimson | `right` | `jules_neutral`, `jules_suspicious`, `jules_confident`, `jules_shocked`, `jules_dead` |\n| `lena` | `Lena` | Retired inspector; direct pressure, vote discipline | Steel blue | `right` | `lena_neutral`, `lena_suspicious`, `lena_confident`, `lena_shocked`, `lena_dead` |\n| `owen` | `Owen` | Nervous scholar; hesitant but remembers details | Green | `right` | `owen_neutral`, `owen_suspicious`, `owen_confident`, `owen_shocked`, `owen_dead` |\n\n---\n\n### 4.3 Card Decks\n\nThis game does not use card battle mechanics.\n\n`MainTableScene.getCardDeck()` returns:\n\n```json\n[]\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4.4 Question Banks\n\nThis game does not use quiz mechanics.\n\n`MainTableScene.getQuestionBank()` returns:\n\n```json\n[]\n```\n\n`QuizModal` is not created or displayed in this game.\n\n---\n\n### 4.5 Deterministic Scripted AI Design\n\nNo real LLM calls. No external AI services. No new behavior class.\n\nAll AI behavior is deterministic table-driven logic resolved inside existing `MainTableScene` hooks:\n\n- `onEnemyAction`\n- `executeEnemyTurn`\n- `onPlayerTurnStart`\n\n#### AI Personality Priorities\n\n| AI | Primary\n\n---\n\nArchetype: ui_heavy"}]}}
