{"type":"stream_event","uuid":"bb7877f0-1bf9-47fe-ba5d-df3bbfeb2ccc","session_id":"0bc7a0e1-d40d-44b4-8483-9aafe24c8f5b","parent_tool_use_id":null,"event":{"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"input_json_delta","partial_json":"{\"plan\":\"## Midnight Table: Seven-Player Mafia — Implementation Plan\\n\\n**Config & Registration**\\n1. `gameConfig.json`: set screenSize 1536×1024, merge `gameplayConfig`/`dialogueConfig`/`mafiaConfig` (keep debugConfig/renderConfig)\\n2. `main.ts`: register RoleRevealScene, MainTableScene, EndgameScene\\n3. `LevelManager.ts`: LEVEL_ORDER = [\\\"RoleRevealScene\\\",\\\"MainTableScene\\\",\\\"EndgameScene\\\"]\\n4. `TitleScreen.ts`: title \\\"MIDNIGHT TABLE\\\", use role_reveal_bg, role_reveal_bgm\\n\\n**Core logic (new `src/game/`)**\\n5. `MafiaTypes.ts` — shared types\\n6. `MafiaEngine.ts` — singleton `mafiaGame`: random role deal, per-AI suspicion model, night resolution (mafia kill / detective investigate / doctor protect), scripted personality-driven discussion lines + evidence cards, vote tally (plurality, tie=no elim), win check (Town: both mafia dead; Mafia: mafia≥town)\\n\\n**Scenes**\\n7. `RoleRevealScene.ts` (BaseChapterScene) — deals roles, branch dialogue reveals only human's role (+ partner if Mafia) → MainTableScene\\n8. `MainTableScene.ts` (BaseBattleScene, useTurnCycle=false) — circular 7-seat table, left ledger panel (claims/votes/deaths), right chat+log panel with DOM text input + reaction buttons, top phase banner/timer/alive count, bottom phase action buttons. Drives Night→Dawn→Discussion→HotSeat→Vote→Elimination loop, preserves hidden info, → EndgameScene\\n9. `EndgameScene.ts` (BaseEndingScene) — victory/defeat title, full role reveal of all 7, match summary + replay timeline → TitleScreen\\n\\n**Verify**: self-review, npm run build, npm run test, npm run dev\\n\\nHidden-info guarantee: seats render neutral/dead textures only; true roles never drawn until death/endgame. Placeholder fallbacks used for missing expression textures.\"}"},"message_id":"dc11ebd8-29d3-43a1-9066-b304ab5af87f"}}
